# Locale

## Conversation

- Reply to the user in **Russian** (questions, explanations, PR/commit descriptions unless they ask otherwise).

## Code and product copy

- **Comments** (any language file): **English only**.
- **Frontend**: user-visible strings — labels, buttons, tooltips, placeholders, `aria-label`, notifications, empty states: **English only**.
- Prefer **English** for new symbol names and log messages in code; match existing project style where files are already mixed.

Do not add Russian text inside source files or UI strings as part of routine changes.
